{"searchPageable":{},"page":{"content":[{"area":"true","publishTime":"2025-03-17 09:36:53","AttExt":"[jpg]","GUID":"","title":"“志向未来<font> </font>魅力三七”学科节——<font>英语</font>小勇士，爱拼才会赢","AttUrl":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/ywdt/zwzl/ggqsydwgk/jy_208048/ptzxx/sdsqddssqzx/jyjx/jxxx/202506/W020250611340411714750.jpg","url":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/ywdt/zwzl/ggqsydwgk/jy_208048/ptzxx/sdsqddssqzx/jyjx/jxxx/202506/t20250611_9649856.shtml","Type":"要闻动态","LinkUrl":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/ywdt/zwzl/ggqsydwgk/jy_208048/ptzxx/sdsqddssqzx/jyjx/jxxx/202506/t20250611_9649856.shtml","Content":"春风拂面，万物复苏。在这春意盎然的时节，为了激发同学们对<font>英语</font>学习的热情，提升<font>词汇</font>运用能力，增强团队合作意识，我校七年级<font>英语</font>集备组精心策划了一场别开生面的“<font>英语</font>小勇士，爱拼才会赢”学科节活动。活动自2月25日启动以来，以\"寓教于乐、以赛促学\"为宗旨，为学子们搭建起一座融趣味与智慧于一体的<font>英语</font>竞技舞台。旨在通过趣味竞赛的形式，让同学们在快乐中学习，在挑战中成长。<font> </font>\n   <font> </font><font> </font>\n**百词争锋，初露锋芒","_id":"qingdao-gov,news,9649856","_searchDataDisplayId":"12","KEYWORDS":"英语 学习 学子","columnName":"教学信息"},{"area":"true","publishTime":"2025-05-14 09:29:19","AttExt":"[jpg]","GUID":"","title":"三维共融<font> </font>跨域赋能——青岛市初中<font>英语</font>阅读素养培训于青岛市教科院附中成功举行","AttUrl":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/ywdt/zwzl/ggqsydwgk/jy_208048/ptzxx/sdsqddssqzx/jyjx/kyxx/202506/W020250611336011159023.jpg","url":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/ywdt/zwzl/ggqsydwgk/jy_208048/ptzxx/sdsqddssqzx/jyjx/kyxx/202506/t20250611_9649808.shtml","Type":"要闻动态","LinkUrl":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/ywdt/zwzl/ggqsydwgk/jy_208048/ptzxx/sdsqddssqzx/jyjx/kyxx/202506/t20250611_9649808.shtml","Content":" <font>\n</font>  \n2025年5月14日，青岛市初中<font>英语</font>阅读素养培训在青岛市教科院附中成功举行，来自青岛市各区市150余名<font>英语</font>教师参加了培训活动。<font> </font>\n \n环节<font>一</font>  课例<font>展</font>示 \n青岛市教科院附属学校乔丽丽老师进行了全市公开课展示，课题是\"The<font> </font>Pursuit<font> </font>of<font> </font>Happyness\"。本节课借助电影欣赏这一独特的教学形式，为学生创造了良好的语言学习情境与实践契机。通过观看电影，学生置身于地道的<font>英语</font>环境","_id":"qingdao-gov,news,9649808","_searchDataDisplayId":"12","KEYWORDS":"拓展 青岛市 阅读","columnName":"教研信息"},{"area":"true","publishTime":"2024-10-22 15:38:55","Type":"要闻动态","LinkUrl":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/ywdt/zwzl/ggqsydwgk/jy_208048/ptzxx/sdsqddjzx/jyjx/kyxx/202410/t20241022_8456845.shtml","Content":"<font> </font><font>\n</font>  \n  \n  聚焦学生深度学习，<font>培</font>养高阶思维能力 \n<font> </font><font> </font>——<font>英语</font>组开展课堂教学模式探究主题教研活动<font> </font>\n<font> </font><font> </font>为提高课堂效率，打造基于学生深度学习的高阶思维能力培养的课堂教学模式，我校<font>英语</font>组对试卷讲评课、听说课和复习课的教学模式进行了探究，董琳茹、李梦、王晶三位老师分别在高三、高二和高一三个年级进行了课例的展示，<font>英语</font>组教师以此次活动为契机，观摩并积极进行教学研讨和实践，落实了教研的规范化、","GUID":"","_id":"qingdao-gov,news,8456845","title":"聚焦学生深度学习，培养高阶思维能力<font> </font>——<font>英语</font>组开展课堂教学模式探究主题教研活动","_searchDataDisplayId":"12","url":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/ywdt/zwzl/ggqsydwgk/jy_208048/ptzxx/sdsqddjzx/jyjx/kyxx/202410/t20241022_8456845.shtml","KEYWORDS":"七选五 学生 老师","columnName":"教研信息"},{"publishTime":"2024-04-24 18:04:00","Type":"扬帆青岛","AttExt":"[jpg]","LinkUrl":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/yfqd/tzqd/tzys/202406/t20240606_8064911.shtml","Content":"Parks          Please<font> </font>click<font> </font>to<font> </font>download：             Qingdao<font> </font>Investment<font> </font>Guide(<font>2024</font>)-English.pdf             Qingdao<font> </font>Investment<font> </font>Guide(<font>2024</font>)-Chinese.pdf             Qingdao<font> </font>Investment<font> </font>Guide(<font>2024</font>)-Japanese.pdf             Qingdao<font> </font>Investment<font> </font>Guide(<font>2024</font>)-Korean.pdf","_id":"qingdao-gov,tour,8064911","title":"<font>2024</font>年青岛市投资指南英文版（Qingdao<font> </font>Investment<font> </font>Guide-<font>2024</font>）","AttUrl":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/yfqd/tzqd/tzys/202406/P020240424550248819489.pdf,http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/yfqd/tzqd/tzys/202406/P020240424591000931790.pdf,http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/yfqd/tzqd/tzys/202406/P020240424591005369190.pdf,http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/yfqd/tzqd/tzys/202406/P020240424591008683888.pdf,http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/yfqd/tzqd/tzys/202406/W020240606547751322844.jpg,http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/yfqd/tzqd/tzys/202406/W020240606547752030066.jpg","_searchDataDisplayId":"15","KEYWORDS":"：             ","url":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/yfqd/tzqd/tzys/202406/t20240606_8064911.shtml","columnName":"投资优势"},{"area":"true","publishTime":"2025-10-14 12:19:47","AttExt":"[pdf]","GUID":"","title":"青岛电子学校<font> </font><font>2024</font>年单位决算","AttUrl":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/ywdt/zwzl/ggqsydwgk/jy_208048/zdzyxx/qddzxx/cwxx/yjsxx/202510/P020251127602839589788.pdf","url":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/ywdt/zwzl/ggqsydwgk/jy_208048/zdzyxx/qddzxx/cwxx/yjsxx/202510/t20251014_10330959.shtml","Type":"要闻动态","LinkUrl":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/ywdt/zwzl/ggqsydwgk/jy_208048/zdzyxx/qddzxx/cwxx/yjsxx/202510/t20251014_10330959.shtml","Content":"<font>2024</font>年度青岛电子学校（山东省青岛第三十二中学）决算.pdf<font> </font>\n","_id":"qingdao-gov,news,10330959","_searchDataDisplayId":"12","KEYWORDS":"青岛 第三十二 决算","columnName":"预决算信息"},{"area":"true","publishTime":"2025-02-25 15:16:05","Type":"要闻动态","LinkUrl":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/ywdt/zwzl/ggqsydwgk/jy_208048/zdzyxx/qddzxx/ghtj/tjsj/202502/t20250225_9003726.shtml","Content":"掌握1-2项体育技能。开展防近视健康教育，落实视力检查与反馈制度，加强“五项管理”的工作落实，全力做好防近视工作。通过定期举办运动会和体育节，激发学生的运动热情，培养团队精神和竞技精神。<font>2024</font>年度，我校体质健康合格率达87.5%，较去年相比增长2.2%。<font> </font>\n<font> </font><font> </font>1.1.6做好安全教育为学生做好保驾护航<font> </font>\n<font> </font><font> </font>学校将安全教育纳入课程体系，确保安全教育的系统性和常态化。制定完善的各类突发事件应急预案，","GUID":"","_id":"qingdao-gov,news,9003726","title":"青岛电子学校<font> </font><font>2024</font>年年度质量报告","_searchDataDisplayId":"12","url":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/ywdt/zwzl/ggqsydwgk/jy_208048/zdzyxx/qddzxx/ghtj/tjsj/202502/t20250225_9003726.shtml","KEYWORDS":"学校 教育 学生","columnName":"统计数据"},{"area":"true","publishTime":"2024-10-22 14:05:15","AttExt":"[pdf]","GUID":"","title":"青岛电子学校<font> </font><font>2024</font>年单位预算","AttUrl":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/ywdt/zwzl/ggqsydwgk/jy_208048/zdzyxx/qddzxx/cwxx/yjsxx/202410/P020241022507626105089.pdf","url":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/ywdt/zwzl/ggqsydwgk/jy_208048/zdzyxx/qddzxx/cwxx/yjsxx/202410/t20241022_8456318.shtml","Type":"要闻动态","LinkUrl":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/ywdt/zwzl/ggqsydwgk/jy_208048/zdzyxx/qddzxx/cwxx/yjsxx/202410/t20241022_8456318.shtml","Content":"\n<font> </font><font>\n</font><font> \n  </font>2024年青岛电子学校（山东省青岛第三十二中学）预算.pdf\n  \n \n","_id":"qingdao-gov,news,8456318","_searchDataDisplayId":"12","KEYWORDS":"青岛 第三十二 山东省","columnName":"预决算信息"},{"area":"true","publishTime":"2024-03-30 16:42:28","Type":"要闻动态","LinkUrl":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/ywdt/zwzl/ggqsydwgk/jy_208048/zdzyxx/qddzxx/zslq/zsxx/202408/t20240828_8204261.shtml","Content":"\n<font> </font><font>\n</font> \n  01招生计划\n<font> </font><font> </font>面向四区（市南区、市北区、李沧区、崂山区，下同）和高新区，单独编班，部分寄宿。\n<font> </font><font> </font>\n  02报名条件\n<font> </font><font> </font>考生符合下列条件之一者可以报考：\n<font> </font><font> </font>1.具有四区和高新区初中学籍，且在<font>2024</font>年青岛市初中学业水平考试报名期间未在休学期内的应届初中毕业生。\n<font> </font><font> </font>2.办理了<font>2024</font>年青岛市初中学业水平考试外地回青、往届生报名手续并审核通过，且户籍在四区和高新区的外地回青、","GUID":"","_id":"qingdao-gov,news,8204261","title":"青岛电子学校<font> </font><font>2024</font>年招生简章","_searchDataDisplayId":"12","url":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/ywdt/zwzl/ggqsydwgk/jy_208048/zdzyxx/qddzxx/zslq/zsxx/202408/t20240828_8204261.shtml","KEYWORDS":"录取 志愿 普通班","columnName":"招生信息"},{"area":"true","publishTime":"2024-02-18 13:40:47","cwTime":"2024-02-18 00:00:00","year":"2024","zc":"0","dropTime":"true","title":"优服务<font> </font><font> </font>护出行<font> </font><font> </font>青岛交通执法圆满完成<font>2024</font>年春节假期<font> </font><font> </font>执法保障工作","url":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/zwgk/xxgk/jtys/gkml/gzxx/202403/t20240306_7891150.shtml","Type":"政务公开","LinkUrl":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/zwgk/xxgk/jtys/gkml/gzxx/202403/t20240306_7891150.shtml","Content":"\n<font> </font><font>\n</font><font> \n  </font>\n  2024年春节假期，青岛市交通运输综合行政执法支队围绕打造“平安春运、便捷春运，温馨春运”目标，突出执法检查、安全生产、应急保障等重点环节，全力开展执法服务保障工作，查处交通运输违法违规行为20起，保障了人民群众平安出行和交通物流畅通高效。\n<font> </font><font> </font>全领域强化执法不松懈。执法支队结合春节假期交通运输市场特点，综合研判，科学制定执法保障方案，召开专题会议，层层动员部署。节日期间，","allowDepartments":"true","policyType":"true","relGuids":"true","_id":"qingdao-gov,pub,7891150","department":"青岛市交通运输局执法支队","fwTime":"2024-02-18 13:40:47","_searchDataDisplayId":"14","KEYWORDS":"执法 执法检查 交通运输","columnName":"工作动态"},{"area":"true","publishTime":"2024-12-19 15:14:26","year":"2024","zc":"0","dropTime":"true","title":"<font>2024</font><font> </font>TPO城市旅游信息交流<font> </font><font> </font>韩国釜山旅游推介","url":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/zwgk/xxgk/whly/gkml/gzxx/202412/t20241219_8716638.shtml","Type":"政务公开","LinkUrl":"http://www.qingdao.gov.cn/zwgk/xxgk/whly/gkml/gzxx/202412/t20241219_8716638.shtml","Content":"\n<font> </font><font>\n</font> \n  中韩两国一衣带水，文化交往源远流长。青岛与釜山于2003年结为友好合作关系城市，不仅在经贸上互通有无，更在文化、旅游等领域紧密合作，共同谱写中韩友谊篇章。亚太城市旅游振兴机构（Tou<font>r</font>ism Promo<font>t</font>ion Organiza<font>t</font>ion<font> </font>for Asian-Pac<font>i</font>fic Cities，简称TPO），成立于2002年，釜山是创始成员之一。TPO旨在振兴亚太地区旅游业，构筑城市合作网","allowDepartments":"true","policyType":"true","relGuids":"true","_id":"qingdao-gov,pub,8716638","fwTime":"2024-12-19 15:14:26","_searchDataDisplayId":"14","KEYWORDS":"釜山 城市 旅游","columnName":"工作动态"}],"total":"11265","aggregations":{"yearAggs":[{"version":"0","term":"2024","count":"6018","termType":"yearAggs"},{"version":"0","term":"2025","count":"1560","termType":"yearAggs"},{"version":"0","term":"2023","count":"264","termType":"yearAggs"},{"version":"0","term":"2026","count":"246","termType":"yearAggs"}],"departmentAggs":[{"version":"0","term":"青岛市司法局","count":"505","termType":"departmentAggs"},{"version":"0","term":"青岛市自然资源和规划局","count":"472","termType":"departmentAggs"},{"version":"0","term":"青岛市文化和旅游局","count":"143","termType":"departmentAggs"},{"version":"0","term":"青岛市人力资源和社会保障局","count":"64","termType":"departmentAggs"},{"version":"0","term":"青岛市住房公积金管理中心","count":"64","termType":"departmentAggs"},{"version":"0","term":"青岛市水务管理局","count":"61","termType":"departmentAggs"},{"version":"0","term":"青岛市科学技术局"